  "gloss": "to comb (hair); to disentangle",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to comb out and smooth (hair); to disentangle",
      "explanation": "To run a comb through hair to remove tangles and smooth it. The reading とく is shared with the homophones {解|と}く (to undo) and {溶|と}く (to dissolve)."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
